From 1da2bcca26b647409cd7673154b341365ccb2242 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:42:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(xtask): the batch gate runs its suites in parallel
 lanes

The batch tier builds each crate alone and then runs the suite steps in
the lane queue of the release tier. The gate skill, the AGENTS.md tier
row and the decision record say so. A quick gate that falls back to the
batch plan uses the lanes too.

Fixes #2727

